      "title": "Stanley Black Gears Up to Report Q3 Earnings: Is a Beat in the Cards?",
      "summary": "Stanley Black & Decker (SWK) is set to report Q3 2026 earnings on Nov. 4, with consensus expectations for a 1% revenue decline to $3.72B but a 7.7% EPS growth to $1.54. Strong power tool demand and cost-cutting efforts are expected to support margins, while the divestiture of Consolidated Aerospace Manufacturing will weigh on the Engineered Fastening segment. An Earnings ESP of +1.10% and Zacks Rank #2 suggest a potential earnings beat.",
